{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10300","headline":"送汤中丞和蕃 · 皇甫曾","name":"送汤中丞和蕃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"继好中司出，天心外国知。\n已传尧雨露，更说汉威仪。\n陇上应回首，河源复载驰。\n孤峯问徒御，空碛见旌麾。\n春草乡愁起，边城旅梦移。\n莫嗟行远地，此去荅恩私。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}